{"page":307,"width":1966,"height":2660,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"입력","words":[{"text":"입력","x":228,"y":148,"width":72,"height":40}]},{"text":"각각의 테스트는 다음 항목을 입력으로 받습니다.","words":[{"text":"각각의","x":225,"y":234,"width":108,"height":38},{"text":"테스트는","x":349,"y":234,"width":147,"height":38},{"text":"다음","x":507,"y":234,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"항목을","x":589,"y":234,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"입력으로","x":710,"y":234,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"받습니다.","x":861,"y":236,"width":147,"height":40}]},{"text":"• 미로 안의 방 개수","words":[{"text":"•","x":277,"y":348,"width":12,"height":12},{"text":"미로","x":327,"y":334,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"안의","x":413,"y":335,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"방","x":497,"y":336,"width":36,"height":36},{"text":"개수","x":545,"y":335,"width":70,"height":38}]},{"text":"• 미로 안의 순간이동장치 개수","words":[{"text":"•","x":277,"y":427,"width":13,"height":12},{"text":"미로","x":328,"y":414,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"안의","x":413,"y":414,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"순간이동장치","x":496,"y":414,"width":209,"height":39},{"text":"개수","x":723,"y":415,"width":69,"height":38}]},{"text":"• 시작 방, 목표 방, 각 순간이동장치에 지정할 점수","words":[{"text":"•","x":277,"y":507,"width":13,"height":12},{"text":"시작","x":328,"y":494,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"방,","x":413,"y":494,"width":44,"height":38},{"text":"목표","x":474,"y":496,"width":73,"height":35},{"text":"방,","x":558,"y":494,"width":44,"height":40},{"text":"각","x":619,"y":495,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"순간이동장치에","x":665,"y":495,"width":242,"height":39},{"text":"지정할","x":923,"y":496,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"점수","x":1038,"y":495,"width":69,"height":38}]},{"text":"출력","words":[{"text":"출력","x":224,"y":642,"width":77,"height":41}]},{"text":"그램은 먼저 플레이어의 점수를 무한대로 낮출 수 있는 경로가 존재하는지를 확인해야 합니","words":[{"text":"그램은","x":306,"y":730,"width":107,"height":36},{"text":"먼저","x":429,"y":730,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"플레이어의","x":512,"y":732,"width":173,"height":37},{"text":"점수를","x":704,"y":732